 turmeric, promoting consistency for long-term cycle support and hormonal balance." </p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R1ij2:-trigger-18935e55-bcf5-43f2-95fa-045af8d1e2093" id="radix-:R1ij2:-content-18935e55-bcf5-43f2-95fa-045af8d1e2093" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="ca6b2c1c-16c7-4715-b339-25eb24009ab0" class="r-1etvvzq"><picture data-rid="5f9987e9-bcbe-49ca-9eea-9de1443bce72" class="r-7wzlpe"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/1_2_aaa7a350-73cd-4404-ba37-07284d15cb20.webp?v=1737642708&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" alt="A person outdoors holding a stethoscope while smiling." class="r-1hyukff" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="45ed945d-b628-4be4-a114-02b7552b5a76" class="r-q8o0ar"><div data-rid="bec66c2a-c852-4a65-9b33-11401c5bc9d7" class="r-63r3wx alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-color:#252a31;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-fontsize:22px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0